          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "5. When the light is incident along the normal on the mirror, which of the following statements is true:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.162,
            0.383,
            0.44,
            0.403
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(i) Angle of incidence is 90°"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.156,
            0.405,
            0.43,
            0.425
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(ii) Angle of incidence is 0°"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.427,
            0.44,
            0.447
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(iii) Angle of reflection is 90°"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.449,
            0.489,
            0.489
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(iv) No reflection of light takes place in this case"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.128,
            0.495,
            0.489,
            0.626
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "6. Three mirrors—plane, concave and convex are placed in Fig. 10.25. On the basis of the images of the graph sheet formed in the mirrors, identify the mirrors and write their names above the mirrors."
            }
          ]
        },
